WEBVTT

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.180
Taito...

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.390
I really...

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:16.820
...like you.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.850
I have to make my feelings clear.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:24.260
Even if I end up hurting 
Haruka in the process...

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:28.160
I promised to always 
be by Himea's side...

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.840
Shigure Residence

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.190
Haruka.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.730
Uh, hello?

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.440
What's up, Haruka?

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.450
Taito-kun?

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.220
Oh, uh...

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.660
Mrs. Shigure?

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.360
Um, Taito-kun?

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.580
Is Haruka with you?

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.210
Huh? No, she's not...

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.810
Don't lie to me.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.580
I won't get mad.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.570
No matter what happens between you two.

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.800
Wait, Mrs. Shigure. What 
are you talking about?

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.940
I don't understand what's going on.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.850
Haruka hasn't come home.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.330
It's so late,

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.910
but she's not answering her phone!

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:19.950
Y-You're...

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.280
What do you mean?!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.120
Exactly what I said.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:08.480
I thought I made it simple enough 
for an idiot to understand.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.840
Don't mess around!

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.170
Wasn't she supposed to be with 
someone from the military?!

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:18.090
"Classmate Spirited Away"

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:16.120
They've always been incompetent.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:18.260
Um, let's see...

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:23.890
Suzae Saeko's vehicle 
was attacked by two men

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.920
who were using magic.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:34.110
At the moment, it is unclear 
which organization they belong to

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:38.600
or why they kidnapped the 
passenger Shigure Haruka.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:39.400
Huh...

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:42.780
Hey, what does kidnap mean?

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.570
Is Haruka a kidnap?

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.580
This is my fault...

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:52.550
Huh?

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:56.420
It's my fault that 
Haruka was kidnapped...

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:56.420
No, no.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.210
You're thinking...

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.140
It must have been you, Edelka!

00:03:59.140 --> 00:03:59.990
That's bull!

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:01.850
Bullshit!

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:06.690
If you assumed that the price for 
that wish wouldn't be as steep,

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.970
you are gravely mistaken.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.450
See for yourself.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:17.610
That you have lost something 
very important...

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.520
Dammit! Dammit!

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:21.680
Why?! Why Haruka?!

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:23.500
Whoa! What's wrong, immortal guy?!

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.230
Hey, stop it!

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:27.000
I don't know what happened,

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.130
but hurting yourself 
isn't going to help.

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:34.040
Yeah...

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:37.300
I can't do anything 
about this situation...

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:49.970
What's this about?

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.910
Please lend me your strength...

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:57.980
I hate to admit it, but I don't 
have the ability to find Haruka.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.570
But you do!

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.750
Lend me your strength!

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.730
Please, I beg of you!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.920
The act of prostrating yourself 
is worth nothing to me.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:23.720
I was going to find Shigure 
Haruka regardless.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.340
Gekkou...

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:28.850
The students of this 
school are all my slaves.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:31.760
I won't allow them to be harmed.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.160
Gekkou's so cool!

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.070
But he makes everything so complicated.

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:40.160
You could just say that we're going 
to save Haruka-chan together.

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.800
Everyone...

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:46.610
Man, beautiful youthful friendship.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.840
What do you want?

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:53.320
I'm sorry to say that I 
don't have time to waste

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.750
on an incompetent failure who 
couldn't even keep a student safe.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.650
As always, it's only your mouth 
that's actually competent.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.690
You've got some nerve 
to show your face...

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.010
Attention, all students.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:14.880
There's been a report that a bomb was 
discovered in the cellar of the school.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:19.730
The school will be closed until 
the bomb has been disposed of.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:23.270
All students should immediately go home.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.890
And there you have it.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.390
You should all leave at once.

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:32.200
If you don't hurry, you'll go boom!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.100
Boom?

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.120
Yes, boom!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:43.130
Making up a bomb threat so they can 
send troops to take control of the school...

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:45.840
Explain what's going on here.

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:48.890
I'll cut to the chase.

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:52.340
Please give up on Shigure Haruka.

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:54.260
What?!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.500
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:58.870
It was a high-level political decision.

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.410
Isn't that right, Suzae-san?

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:07.820
The military has learned that the 
church has been involved in recent events.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.110
What did you say?

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.320
The church...

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:13.350
They're the ones who 
made Himea suffer...

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:21.270
Hey! Why did they kidnap Haruka?!

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:22.360
Beats me.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:25.810
They must have found a use for her?

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:27.500
Hey, I have a question.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.130
Go ahead, Aomi-san.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:32.200
If you know that they have her, why 
aren't you trying to negotiate a deal.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.400
Tell them to give back Haruka-chan.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:37.900
Well, there are reasons 
why we can't do that.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:41.680
To be honest, the military is 
on bad terms with the church.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:42.970
Then we'll do this...

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:45.350
That would be even worse.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:49.540
They believe that you're 
working for the military.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:52.630
One wrong move and you'll start a war.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.070
In other words,

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:57.450
you kids should stay home.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.700
That's why you're telling 
us to give up on Haruka?!

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:02.640
Yes.

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:05.650
Well, she was in the wrong 
place at the wrong time.

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:07.000
You bastard!

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:10.000
And you've made the 
wrong decision again.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:13.380
Don't you understand the overwhelming 
difference between your strength and mine?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.070
Get that smirk off your face!

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:17.100
I was expecting that.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.900
Kurenai-kun tends to wait for 
an opportunity to counterattack.

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:27.610
If you show him an opening, he'll 
leap like a mouse into a trap.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:28.730
Enough of your prattle!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.670
Taito! Run!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.130
Taito!

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:42.110
Oh, I always forget 
to control my strength

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:44.750
because Kurogane-kun 
has such a tough body.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.180
How dare you hurt Taito!

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.680
Now, time for your punishment.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.210
Damn you...

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:58.950
Hey! Don't bully Gekkou!

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.050
Your teacher is very sad.

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:04.830
I see that none of you have 
improved after the training camp.

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:07.540
I am very disappointed.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:11.860
One wrong decision can cost 
you your life in a battle.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.910
Hey, I have an idea.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:19.870
What is it?

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.120
We surrender!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.980
Fool, what are you doing?!

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:27.040
Now, now.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.920
You can't do anything if you're dead.

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.300
Man, I'm glad that I recruited 
Aomi-san into the student council.

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:38.360
Now I don't have to hurt 
my beloved students.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.450
Taito, are you okay?!

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:41.760
Gekkou!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.580
Sorry, Himea...

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:48.190
I'm sorry. Was that unnecessary?

00:09:48.890 --> 00:09:50.860
You're apologizing to the wrong person.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:56.610
He'll regret not killing 
me, sooner or later.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.250
This is...

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.870
You're finally awake?

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:15.420
Well, you probably would 
be better off asleep.

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:32.390
Taito really cares about her...

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.160
Who are you?

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:43.120
A pleasure to meet you, 
vampire Saitohimea-san.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:47.990
I am Serge Entolio. I make 
my living as a Spell Breaker.

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:49.500
Spell Breaker?

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:55.750
Yes, I remove and seal various 
curses and spells, for a price.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.830
So? What business do you have with me?

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.550
I don't recall ever 
requesting your help.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:06.620
I actually have a proposition to make.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:12.150
What is your goal?

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:13.710
To make a deal.

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:14.730
A deal?

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:19.560
Yes, we offer to exchange 
Shigure Haruka for you.

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:25.100
I see. So the church was 
after me from the beginning.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:29.250
Oh? If you understand, that 
should make this quick.

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:34.070
We were hired to capture 
and seal Saitohimea.

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:37.670
Shigure Haruka was captured 
to serve as bait.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:41.700
Unfortunately, I couldn't care 
less about what happens to her...

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.110
You may not care...

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.570
I love that look on your face.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:51.700
Makes it more fun to torture you.

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:52.660
Come on!

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.670
Let me see the despair in your eyes, eh?

00:11:56.820 --> 00:12:02.450
However, when Shigure Haruka is beaten 
into a shell of her former self,

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.440
how will Kurogane Taito react?

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.930
The human heart is fragile.

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:15.440
He will be forced to live 
an eternity in despair.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:20.330
What would be the right thing for 
you to do for the one you love?

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.740
I'm sure you know the answer.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.310
Deal.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.400
We'll be waiting for you.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:36.900
You're really going to leave?

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:51.330
Yeah, I thought I'd do some snooping 
around, and look what I've found.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:54.230
Are you really sure about this?

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:57.080
You'll never see Kurogane-kun again.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:12:59.960
I see.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:02.610
You're going to sacrifice 
yourself for the one you love.

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:05.170
So you're pretty old-fashioned.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:09.710
Well, I guess I shouldn't say that 
when you've lived ten thousand years.

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:13.180
Yeah, sorry for being 
a smart-alecky human,

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:16.620
You're a strange human.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:17.880
I get that a lot.

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:22.750
So, you haven't changed your mind?

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:27.990
Taito belonged on the other side...

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.260
I don't want to get him 
involved in any more trouble.

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:33.040
Besides, I've already received so much.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:36.810
More memories than I can hold onto.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:40.500
That's enough for me.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.370
You really love him.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:46.910
But it's too bad.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:50.090
I had a lot of fun.

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:53.750
Watching you and Kurogane-kun 
act all lovey-dovey.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.820
Izumi, we didn't get to spend 
a lot of time together,

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.230
but it's been fun.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.960
Goodbye.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.000
Ah. Geez...

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.340
Damn Gekkou...

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:15.620
What's he doing...

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:17.150
What should I do?

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:18.800
What should I do to save Haruka?!

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:21.540
Why can't I do anything by myself?!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:22.880
Alto.

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:34.020
Here I am.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.100
So this is Taito's room...

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.670
I told Izumi that I've had enough,

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:44.240
but I guess I'm just greedy.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.490
I'm sorry, Taito...

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.410
I love you.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.370
Huh? I was...

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:36.490
Bro, you have a visitor.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:38.300
Hello.

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.310
Welcome.

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:02.530
I'm here.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:04.810
Now let her go.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:07.270
We can't do that.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:09.730
She still has a use.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:10.740
What?

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.130
No!

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:16.260
Himea's going to take Haruka's place?

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.030
What the hell?

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:19.160
She didn't tell me anything!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:20.700
Why would she...

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:26.270
You don't know why she did this?

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:27.280
Izumi...

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:32.360
Hime-chan's lived ten thousand 
years and possesses super powers,

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:35.940
but around you, she was 
just a girl in love.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:41.290
So what are you going to do?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:42.480
I'm...

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:50.510
...going to bring Himea back.

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:51.210
Uh-huh.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:53.230
And take Haruka back.

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:53.990
Uh-huh.

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:57.160
I realize that I'm not that strong,

00:16:57.650 --> 00:17:02.080
but I'll crawl on the ground if that's 
what it takes to get them back!

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.460
Well said!

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:05.450
Ow. Thanks, Izumi.

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:07.490
Ooh, you're looking much sharper now.

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:10.920
Hello?

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:13.060
We're taking back the 
student council office.

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:14.010
Gekkou?!

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.720
If you want to make yourself 
useful, come to the front gate.

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:19.430
You can at least serve 
as a human shield.

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:23.500
Gekkou, are you feeling better?

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:26.040
If you aren't, I'll sing the 
Bu-chan-man song for you!

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:26.830
No, thanks.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:33.930
Gekkou?

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:36.240
Just shut up and follow me.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:37.740
Uh-huh!

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.810
Zap away!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:52.310
Hey, you shouldn't kill them...

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.050
Don't worry.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:56.120
Those are Kurosu's shikigami.

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:01.130
Okay. No need to hold back then.

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:02.850
Let's move.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:03.890
Yeah!

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:06.110
There are trespassers inside the school!

00:18:06.110 --> 00:18:08.210
They've broken through 
the first perimeter!

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:10.130
So they've come.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:12.400
I like it.

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:16.170
Kids are supposed to rebel 
against the establishment.

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:17.450
Spell Breakers?

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:22.020
Uh-huh, Hime-chan was talking 
to someone named Serge.

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:23.450
Serge Entolio.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.780
He and his younger brother Hasga

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:27.590
are Spell Breakers who have seen 
a lot of business recently.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:30.280
You've heard of them?

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:32.760
Don't you realize who I am?

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:35.810
I have an idea about where the 
Entolio brothers might be.

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:38.540
They've broken through 
the third perimeter!

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:39.880
What's going on...

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:42.550
It's as though they're aiming for 
the weakest areas of our defenses.

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:45.630
They've got a talented 
scout on their side.

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:48.790
A pretty fine team, I'd say.

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:49.970
Kurosu-san?

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:54.850
It appears that I'll be forced to go 
greet them as the last line of defense.

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:56.110
That won't be necessary.

00:18:57.850 --> 00:18:59.700
We've come to you.

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:04.200
How naughty of you to be walking 
around at such a late hour.

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:06.920
That's my seat.

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:09.420
The elderly should be 
drinking tea on a porch.

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:11.050
How rude.

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:13.550
Suzae-san isn't that old yet.

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:14.850
Me?!

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.300
Forgive me...

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:21.500
You won't be making 
fun of us much longer.

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:22.540
Open!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:27.860
Oh, you know who kidnapped Shigure-san.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:30.100
But I can't let you 
pass through that rift.

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:31.480
Charge.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:32.390
Okay!

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.060
Go!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.520
You never change, Kurenai-kun.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:40.060
Haven't you realized that 
you're limiting yourself...

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:47.100
What were you saying?

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.770
Go, Kurogane Taito!

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:50.030
Don't die!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:57.100
You've learned how to become a 
tool for the sake of someone else.

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:59.090
You've finally achieved a passing grade.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:07.260
Now, it's time for a fun remedial class.

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:13.410
Himea... Haruka...

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:15.280
I'm coming to save you!

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:52.580
I have captured Saitohimea, 
as requested.

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:58.670
How very typical of half-breeds 
to use a human hostage.

00:21:58.670 --> 00:21:59.940
You bastard!

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:01.010
Bro...

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:04.460
I look forward to doing 
more business with you.

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:20.320
Are you awake?

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:26.360
Uh-huh, the ignorant side of 
me must have been frightened.

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.340
Did she struggle?

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:30.320
You should ask Serge.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:33.460
Man, I always get stuck 
with the dirty work.

00:22:33.460 --> 00:22:37.450
I really can't stand making 
girls cry and stuff.

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:41.210
But my pure heart would prevent me 
from ever performing such a task.

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:44.440
No, you've got a nasty streak deep down.

00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:47.300
Oh, is that what you think about me?

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:48.480
I'm shocked.

00:22:49.190 --> 00:22:51.110
You brothers are very close.

00:22:51.110 --> 00:22:54.490
Let's get to the business at hand.

00:22:54.490 --> 00:22:59.010
Your request is for us to seal the 
"observer" personality inside you.

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:00.350
Is that correct?

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:02.860
Uh-huh, it is.

00:23:03.160 --> 00:23:06.270
In other words, you want 
us to destroy your persona,

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:12.100
the one that was created by the 
Seraphim to monitor Kurogane Taito.

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:13.260
I know.

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:17.950
You'll receive the information 
about the Seraphim

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:20.730
that's in my head when 
you destroy me, right?

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:23.550
Yes, that will more than 
pay for the service.

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:26.710
We will do the best job we can.

00:23:27.650 --> 00:23:29.500
Promise me one last thing.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:33.950
Once you've destroyed me 
and sealed Saitohimea,

00:23:33.950 --> 00:23:38.970
return this girl, Shigure 
Haruka, to Kurogane Taito.

00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:44.500
She found the courage to 
tell him how she feels.

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:47.480
So she no longer needs me.

00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:51.030
You have such a beautiful smile.

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:54.190
I envy the man who has your affection.

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:15.090
Oh, I just realized that we 
haven't talked much, Gekkou.

00:24:15.090 --> 00:24:18.300
Yes, and I have no plans 
to talk with trash.

00:24:18.300 --> 00:24:18.680
Scram.

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:20.560
Yeah, yeah. Got it.

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:21.400
Hey, by the way...

00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:22.710
I told you to scram.

00:24:22.710 --> 00:24:24.310
Do you have a girlfriend?

00:24:24.310 --> 00:24:24.730
What?!

00:24:24.730 --> 00:24:26.010
Of course, you do.

00:24:26.010 --> 00:24:27.440
Look at how popular you are.

00:24:27.700 --> 00:24:30.360
But what about Mirai?

00:24:30.360 --> 00:24:33.070
I don't have time to answer 
your stupid question.

00:24:33.070 --> 00:24:34.820
What?! You're going out with Mirai?!

00:24:34.820 --> 00:24:35.980
Okay, get down on your knees.

00:24:35.070 --> 00:24:40.650
Next Time: "Summer Vacation Catastrophe"

00:24:35.980 --> 00:24:36.580
I'm going to kill you.

00:24:36.580 --> 00:24:37.850
Damn! I guessed right?!

00:24:37.850 --> 00:24:38.830
Die!
